args: opentide --json generate explorer --help
exit: 0

━━━ stdout
Write explorer.bundle.json and explorer.search.json under .opentide/exports/.

Usage: opentide generate explorer [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --include-visibility
          Also write explorer.visibility.json: the log sources visibility.toml declares and the rules that use them. Off by default: it shows what you cannot see. A run without it removes the file

      --visibility-tlp <VISIBILITY_TLP>
          The TLP the explorer shows on the Visibility view: clear, green, amber, amber+strict or red
          
          [default: amber]

      --help
          Print help

Examples:
  $ opentide generate explorer

━━━ stderr · empty
